Hi {!Contact.FirstName},
Thank you again for your interest in a graduate degree program in Arizona State University’s College of Health Solutions. As your admission representative, I can discuss with you the details of the program, including the curriculum, program format, tuition and more.
At this time, your admission application is incomplete. To guide you along the application process, let’s schedule an appointment to create a submission date timeline. Are you available this Wednesday afternoon?
If you have further questions, please feel free to email me at your convenience. Sincerely,
{!User.Email}
